        "added": "**Current-source correction.** The large-time statement in the historical declaration above is too broad. The limit is zero when the nonnegative operator has a zero eigenvalue. For a positive-definite operator, the diagnostic instead grows asymptotically linearly with time. The zero-time limit remains zero. Section 53.3 gives the corrected interpretation, consistent with the current source at commit `5f2b7ddc879c12d2bb00cbe5c487aa0bc7709222`.",
